td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Goat</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Fibronectin</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Pepsin 0.4&#x00025; w/v</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x02009;:&#x02009;1000</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">on RT</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Sigma, St Louis, MO, USA</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">MMP-2</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">CA-4001</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Mouse</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Proform of MMP-2</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">None</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x02009;:&#x02009;200</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">on RT</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Neomarkers, Fremont, CA, USA</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">VEGF-A</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Rabbit</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">VEGF-A</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Pepsin 0.4&#x00025; w/v</td><td align="center" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x02009;:&#x02009;100</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">2&#x02009;h RT</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Santa Cruz Biotechnology Inc., Santa Cruz, CA, USA</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="t2-fn1"><label/><p>bFGF=basic fibroblast growth factor; VEGF=vascular endothelial growth factor-A.</p></fn><fn id="t2-fn2"><label>a</label><p>On=overnight.</p></fn><fn id="t2-fn3"><label>b</label><p>RT=room temperature.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>